                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petite ville ou grand village ; lieu de rendez-vous lors des marchés hebdomadaires."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91e03422-869a-4856-b540-dc7e4fc793db",
                                                "sense_id": "7bf3944a-f799-3422-b794-1d050630beff",
                                                "text": "En effet, en exécution de ces lettres patentes, l’emplacement pour bâtir le nouveau bourg fut tracé au delà de l’Aude, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95cfa295-d7ba-4f32-ad50-6a5f33e48992",
                                                "sense_id": "7bf3944a-f799-3422-b794-1d050630beff",
                                                "text": "Pas de fermes isolées, rien que des bourgs formés de maisons les plus dissemblables, qu’une lézarde de géraniums essaye en vain d’appareiller […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2ac5f0f-48fa-4291-afb5-3c42bc762da4",
                                                "sense_id": "7bf3944a-f799-3422-b794-1d050630beff",
                                                "text": "[…] Saint-Cirq-la-Popie était, au moyen-âge, une riche cité fortifiée ; il n’est plus qu’un bourg croulant où s’attardent 150 habitants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61fc7d53-7463-4425-bd72-4ffc3431d554",
                                                "sense_id": "7bf3944a-f799-3422-b794-1d050630beff",
                                                "text": "Voilà une existence qui n'a rien à voir avec celle que j'ai connue dans un bourg morvandiau, au milieu des toucheurs de bœufs et des mineurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "996280a2-7345-33d8-9219-5198e32ade12",
                                        "entry_id": "b29d87d9-4bed-3852-89a2-9cf880581245",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Municipalité autonome (dans un contexte historique: municipalité autonome, sans aucun devoir envers un seigneur féodal)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d18aae10-32c0-381c-b778-b82942a9b7f0",
                                        "entry_id": "b29d87d9-4bed-3852-89a2-9cf880581245",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Centre-ville ; lieu de vie du village."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0efefc9-167b-4511-85ad-4f6029a38314",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6c299ba-7685-34a9-bf67-005cb34507af",
                        "source_sense_description": "торговое поселение",
                        "target_lang_word": "bourgade",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bourgade",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c30a48e8-1040-30fb-ab04-282bbbb9899d",
                                        "entry_id": "53a87eba-6c6f-3fd9-8958-635652b65a26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit bourg, village dont les maisons disséminées occupent un assez grand espace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c948ee9-d8e2-45da-b18e-57dc64e8d37f",
                                                "sense_id": "c30a48e8-1040-30fb-ab04-282bbbb9899d",
                                                "text": "Après Mondragon, qui est la dernière bourgade, comme on dit en Espagne, le dernier pueblo de la province de Guipuscoa, nous entrâmes dans la province d’Alava, et nous ne tardâmes pas à nous trouver au bas de la montagne de Salinas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29d26ba9-d54b-47d2-aff5-c8967f167c45",
                                                "sense_id": "c30a48e8-1040-30fb-ab04-282bbbb9899d",
                                                "text": "Quelles causes profondes, quelles turpitudes amenèrent donc l’annihilation de ce qui est une riante bourgade ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09ef2c6b-c1ec-47cc-bbfa-996009a12a03",
                                                "sense_id": "c30a48e8-1040-30fb-ab04-282bbbb9899d",
                                                "text": "Or, nous devons tout essayer pour maintenir peuplés ces plateaux de sol ingrat et non chercher à éloigner la population, l’obligeant […] à périr de la poitrine dans des bourgades industrielles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca30ec12-0f9f-41c6-a00f-a4114542599f",
                                                "sense_id": "c30a48e8-1040-30fb-ab04-282bbbb9899d",
                                                "text": "Le Mesnil-lès-Hurlus, un nom de village prédestiné, de mauvais augure, empli de hurlements avant un silence de mort. Rasée, rayée de la carte durant l'hiver 1915, la bourgade ne fut jamais reconstruite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "17c4077b-5baf-4917-b8cf-f32a81138c2b",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6c299ba-7685-34a9-bf67-005cb34507af",
                        "source_sense_description": "пригород",
                        "target_lang_word": "suburb",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suburb",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b5b6c53-49de-35fd-b893-9f61024fe050",
                                        "entry_id": "495782ce-392c-3734-8784-2a6606193cd5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A residential area located on the outskirts of a city or large town that usually includes businesses that cater to its residents; such as schools, grocery stores, shopping centers, restaurants, convenience stores, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc9a7736-c49e-4fa4-8ed5-b97082263e81",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6c53-49de-35fd-b893-9f61024fe050",
                                                "text": "And the Lord spake vnto Moses in the plaines of Moab by Iordane, neere Iericho, saying,\nCommand the children of Israel, that they giue vnto the Leuites of the inheritance of their possession, cities to dwell in: and yee shall giue also vnto the Leuites suburbs for the cities round about them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "105daf71-6096-4be6-ba79-ecc3207936e6",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6c53-49de-35fd-b893-9f61024fe050",
                                                "text": "These two circumstances, however, happening both unfortunately to intervene, our travellers deviated into a much less frequented track; and after riding full six miles, instead of arriving at the stately spires of Coventry, they found themselves still in a very dirty lane, where they saw no symptoms of approaching the suburbs of a large city."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e8cc0ef-a988-43f1-930d-91b559a5eb6c",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6c53-49de-35fd-b893-9f61024fe050",
                                                "text": "[London] could hardly have contained less than thirty or forty thousand souls within its walls; and the suburbs were very populous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d8d2037-0d7c-4abb-af3a-0c676096a946",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6c53-49de-35fd-b893-9f61024fe050",
                                                "text": "Canton is by no means the only great city in the province. Fo-chan, a kind of suburb to it, about twelve miles distant, has been represented as almost as large."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2b88499-4647-4fe0-851a-ffa33271f93d",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6c53-49de-35fd-b893-9f61024fe050",
                                                "text": "At the mountain’s base is the leafy suburb of Kowloon Tong. It has never been a big tourist draw, but in the decade since territorial control returned to China, this quintessentially Hong Kong neighborhood has had many more visitors — and important changes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f5b8006-7f5a-4325-a90e-6cc57fdfffc5",
                                                "sense_id": "4b5b6c53-49de-35fd-b893-9f61024fe050",
                                                "text": "I’m not surprised that Rudd seizes on my accent – his parents were British Jews from Edgware and Surbiton, and while Rudd was born in New Jersey in 1969 and raised in the US, he was often in Britain as a kid to visit relatives in London’s less glamorous suburbs and Basingstoke."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "278c5c09-5fba-3587-babc-5c511d54c730",
                                        "entry_id": "495782ce-392c-3734-8784-2a6606193cd5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The outer part; the environment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02fd304b-84d2-44bb-a273-05a094387eff",
                                                "sense_id": "278c5c09-5fba-3587-babc-5c511d54c730",
                                                "text": "the suburbs […] of sorrow"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b83432e5-b9b5-4c40-8617-0ec90260678d",
                                                "sense_id": "278c5c09-5fba-3587-babc-5c511d54c730",
                                                "text": "the suburb of their straw-built citadel"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "166eadd2-ce86-3378-b524-7c6002e9adf3",
                                        "entry_id": "495782ce-392c-3734-8784-2a6606193cd5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any subdivision of a conurbation, not necessarily on the periphery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "New-Zealand",
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
